{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q389444","formula":"CaAl₂Si₄O₁₂·4H₂O","hill":"Al2CaH8O16Si4","elements":["H","O","Al","Si","Ca"],"composition":{"H":8.0,"O":16.0,"Al":2.0,"Ca":1.0,"Si":4.0},"names":{"en":"Laumontite","ru":"Ломонтит","uk":"Ломонтит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Laumontite is a mineral, one of the zeolite group. Its molecular formula is CaAl2Si4O12·4H2O, a hydrated calcium-aluminium silicate. Potassium or sodium may substitute for the calcium but only in very small amounts.","ru":"Ломонти́т (Laumontite) — минерал, водный алюмосиликат кальция из группы цеолитов. Его молекулярная формула Ca(Si4Al2)O12•4H2O Своё название минерал получил в честь французского минералога Ж. Ломонта, который в 1785 году собрал образцы в свинцовых рудниках Бретани. Рене-Жюст Гаюи в 1809 году дал этому минералу название Laumonit.","uk":"Ломонтит — мінерал, водний алюмосилікат кальцію каркасної будови, групи цеолітів."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q389444","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laumontite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Prehnite-Laumontite-132299.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q422100","formula":"Ca(Si₃Al₂)O₁₀·3H₂O","names":{"en":"Scolecite","ru":"Сколецит","uk":"Сколецит"},"elemen